             (f'Subject: Updated procedures at {company}\n\nThe revised visitor policy [1] approved by the management team yesterday. All visitors must now sign in at reception and wear a temporary badge while on site.\n\nStaff are responsible [2] collecting their guests from the lobby. [3]\n\nThe policy is designed to improve security without [4] unnecessary delays. Thank you for your cooperation.',[
              q('[1]','was|has|were|being','Yesterday appelle le passé ; policy singulier exige was dans le passif was approved.','tenses'),q('[2]','for|at|with|from','Responsible for + gérondif est la collocation attendue.','prepositions'),q('[3]','Guests should not proceed to the offices unaccompanied.|Visitors are no longer required to check in.|All employees must work from home permanently.|The lobby will be replaced with a garden.','L’accompagnement complète logiquement la procédure d’accueil.','inference'),q('[4]','causing|cause|caused|causes','Après without, préposition, le verbe prend -ing.','agreement')]),
             (f'To: Members of {company}\n\nOur online reservation service will be upgraded on {day2}. The system will be unavailable for approximately two hours while the update is [1]. Existing bookings will remain unchanged.\n\n[2]\n\nThe new interface will make it easier [3] available dates and modify reservations. [4] you experience any difficulty after the update, contact the support team.',[
              q('[1]','installed|installing|installation|installs','Le sujet update subit l’action : is installed.','tenses'),q('[2]','During the interruption, urgent requests can be made by telephone.|All existing reservations have been deleted.|The update took place several years ago.|We recommend booking flights to another country.','La solution téléphonique assure la continuité pendant l’indisponibilité.','inference'),q('[3]','to find|finding|found|finds','Make it easier to + base verbale : to find.','agreement'),q('[4]','Should|Had|Would|Were','Should you experience équivaut à if you should experience.','agreement','C1')]),
