                items=[q('Which qualification is mandatory?',f'{pack} years of customer-facing experience|Fluency in another language|A postgraduate degree|Experience as a trainer','L’expérience minimale est exigée ; une langue supplémentaire est seulement utile.','detail'),q('What working pattern is mentioned?','Two evening shifts per week|Weekends only|Mornings only|One shift per month','L’annonce prévoit deux soirées de travail hebdomadaires.','detail'),q('What would make an application incomplete?','The absence of a cover letter|The absence of a second language|A request for training|A CV with customer service experience','Sans lettre de motivation, le dossier n’est pas pris en compte.','inference')]
