                items=[q('What service is being sought?','Reception staffing|Building demolition|Catering supplies|Computer manufacturing','L’appel d’offres concerne la réception des bureaux.','intent'),q('When are proposals due?',f'{deadline} May at noon|{pack+3} May at noon|1 July at noon|{deadline+5} May at noon','La date de remise est distincte de la visite et du début du contrat.','detail'),q('What is implied about selection?','Non-price criteria matter|The cheapest bidder always wins|All bidders receive contracts|Training will be ignored','Le texte cite fiabilité et formation parmi les critères importants.','inference')]
