                items=[q('How long is the revised stay?',f'{nights} nights|4 nights|{nights+3} nights|1 night',f'Départ le {5+nights}, arrivée le 5 : {nights} nuits.','synthesis','C1'),q('What is the new total, including breakfast?',f'£{total}|£{nightly*nights}|£{total+breakfast}|£{total+nightly}',f'Additionnez le tarif de la chambre et le petit-déjeuner pour chaque nuit : {nights} × ({nightly} + {breakfast}) = {total} livres.','synthesis','C1'),q('Why is the change free?','It was requested before the deadline|The room is unavailable|Breakfast is complimentary|The guest is staying longer','La demande du 27 novembre précède de plus de 48 h l’arrivée du 5 décembre.','synthesis','C1'),q('What remains the same?','The nightly room rate|The departure date|The total bill|The number of nights','La réponse maintient le tarif par nuit.','detail'),q('What does the guest want?','A shorter stay with breakfast|A complete cancellation|A second room|A late checkout on the original date','Le courriel raccourcit le séjour et ajoute le petit-déjeuner.','intent')]
